`;

exports[`templates — one snapshot per kind > query-response: deterministic text, every fact present, tone rules hold 1`] = `
"Your question about GST on office rent (Acme Traders Private Limited)

Dear Ravi Kumar,

Thank you for your question about GST on office rent.

GST at 18% applies to the rent of ₹50,000.00 a month from October 2026.

Your landlord should show it on the invoice.

Regards,
Priya Sharma
Indefine"
`;

